#. help text 1/4
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:62
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"When entering a password, distinguish between uppercase and\n"
"lowercase. Passwords should not contain any accented characters or "
"umlauts. \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເມື່ອປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແຍກລະຫວ່າງຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ. \n"
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານບໍ່ຄວນມີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສຽງ ຫຼື umlauts.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 2/4 %1 is encryption type, %2,%3 numbers
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:73
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"With the current password encryption (%1), the password length should be "
"between\n"
" %2 and %3 characters.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດລະຫັດຜ່ານປັດຈຸບັນ (%1), ຄວາມຍາວຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານຄວນຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ\n"
" %2 ຫາ %3 ຕົວອັກສອນ.\n"
"</p>"

#. help text 4/4
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:90 src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:792
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"To ensure that the password was entered correctly,\n"
"repeat it exactly in a second field. Do not forget your password.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງ,\n"
"ໃຫ້ພິມຄືນໃຫ້ຄືເກົ່າໃນຊ່ອງທີສອງ. ຢ່າລືມລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Help text 0/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:103
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Here, set default values to use when creating new local or system users.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ທີ່ນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບໃໝ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Help text 1/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:109
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Default Group</b><br>\n"
"The group name of a new user's primary group.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ກຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</b><br>\n"
"ຊື່ກຸ່ມຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Help text 2/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:116
msgid ""
"<p><b>Default Login Shell</b><br>\n"
"The name of the new user's login shell. Select one from the list or enter "
"your own path to the shell.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເຊລເຂົ້າລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</b><br>\n"
"ຊື່ຂອງເຊລເຂົ້າລະບົບສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່. ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ ຫຼື ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາເຊລຂອງທ່ານເອງ.</P>\n"

#. Help text 3/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:120
msgid ""
"<p><b>Default Home</b><br>\n"
"The initial path prefix for a new user's home directory. The username is "
"added\n"
"to the end of this value to create the default name of the home directory.\n"
"</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</b><br>\n"
"ຄຳນຳໜ້າເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່. ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມ\n"
"ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"</P>\n"

#. Help text 4.5/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:127
msgid ""
"<p><b>Umask for Home Directory</b><br>\n"
"Umask to use for creating new home directories.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Umask ສຳລັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ</b><br>\n"
"Umask ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກໃໝ່.</p>\n"

#. Help text 5/6:
#. Don't reorder letters YYYY-MM-DD, date must be set in this format
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:132
msgid ""
"<p><b>Expiration Date</b><br>\n"
"The date on which the user account is disabled. The date must be in the "
"format\n"
"YYYY-MM-DD. Leave it empty if this account never expires.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ວັນໝົດອາຍຸ</b><br>\n"
"ວັນທີທີ່ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ວັນທີຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ\n"
"YYYY-MM-DD. ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຫວ່າງຖ້າບັນຊີນີ້ບໍ່ມີວັນໝົດອາຍຸ.</P>\n"

#. Help text 6/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:138
msgid ""
"<P><B>Days after Password Expiration Login Is Usable</B><BR>\n"
"Users can log in after expiration of passwords. Set how many days \n"
"after expiration login is allowed. Use -1 for unlimited access.\n"
"</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ຍັງເຂົ້າລະບົບໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກລະຫັດຜ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ</B><BR>\n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າລະບົບໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກລະຫັດຜ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບໄດ້ອີກຈັກມື້ \n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດອາຍຸ. ໃຊ້ -1 ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ.\n"
"</P>\n"

#. For translators: read dialog help, part 1 of 2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:151
msgid ""
"<P><B><BIG>Initializing User Management</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"Please wait...\n"
"<BR></P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B><BIG>ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...\n"
"<BR></P>\n"

#. For translators: read dialog help, part 2 of 2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:157
msgid ""
"<P><B><BIG>Aborting the Initialization</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"You can safely abort the configuration utility by pressing <B>Abort</B>\n"
"now.\n"
"</P>"
msgstr ""
"<P><B><BIG>ກຳລັງຍົກເລີກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກເຄື່ອງມືການກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການກົດ <B>ຍົກເລີກ</B>\n"
"ດຽວນີ້.\n"
"</P>"

#. For translators: read dialog help, part 1 of 2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:169
msgid ""
"<P><B><BIG>Saving User Configuration</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"Please wait...\n"
"<BR></P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B><BIG>ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການກຳນົດຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...\n"
"<BR></P>\n"

#. For translators: read dialog help, part 2 of 2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:175
msgid ""
"<P><B><BIG>Aborting the Save Process:</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"Abort the save process by pressing <B>Abort</B>.\n"
"An additional dialog will inform you whether it is safe to do so.\n"
"</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B><BIG>ກຳລັງຍົກເລີກຂະບວນການບັນທຶກ:</BIG></B><BR>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກຂະບວນການບັນທຶກໂດຍການກົດ <B>ຍົກເລີກ</B>.\n"
"ຈະມີກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຊາບວ່າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"</P>\n"

#. help text 1/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:192
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Enter the <b>First Name</b>, <b>Last Name</b>, \n"
"<b>Username</b>, and\n"
"<b>Password</b> to assign to this user.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ປ້ອນ <b>ຊື່</b>, <b>ນາມສະກຸນ</b>, \n"
"<b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b>, ແລະ\n"
"<b>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b> ເພື່ອກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. alternative help text 1/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:201 src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:783
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Enter the <b>User's Full Name</b>, <b>Username</b>, and <b>Password</b> to\n"
"assign to this user account.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ປ້ອນ <b>ຊື່ເຕັມຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້</b>, <b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b>, ແລະ <b>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b> ເພື່ອ\n"
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 2/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:215
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Create the <b>Username</b> from components of the full name by\n"
"clicking <b>Suggestion</b>. It may be modified, but use only\n"
"letters (no accented characters), digits, and <tt>._-</tt>.\n"
"Do not use uppercase letters in this entry unless you know what you are "
"doing.\n"
"Usernames have stricter restrictions than passwords. You can redefine the\n"
"restrictions in the /etc/login.defs file. Read its man page for "
"information.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ສ້າງ <b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b> ຈາກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງຊື່ເຕັມໂດຍ\n"
"ຄລິກ <b>ຄຳແນະນຳ</b>. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ\n"
"ຕົວອັກສອນ (ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສຽງ), ຕົວເລກ, ແລະ <tt>._-</tt>.\n"
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ໃນຊ່ອງນີ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງ.\n"
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ເຄັ່ງຄັດກວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້\n"
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ /etc/login.defs. ອ່ານລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ man page.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. alternative help text 2/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:230
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"For the <b>Username</b>, use only\n"
"letters (no accented characters), digits, and <tt>._-</tt>.\n"
"Do not use uppercase letters in this entry unless you know what you are "
"doing.\n"
"Usernames have stricter restrictions than passwords. You can redefine the\n"
"restrictions in the /etc/login.defs file.  Read its man page for "
"information.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ສຳລັບ <b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b>, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ\n"
"ຕົວອັກສອນ (ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສຽງ), ຕົວເລກ, ແລະ <tt>._-</tt>.\n"
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ໃນຊ່ອງນີ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງ.\n"
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ເຄັ່ງຄັດກວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້\n"
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ /etc/login.defs. ອ່ານລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ man page.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. these are used only during installation time
#. help text 4/7 (only during installation)
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:248 src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:802
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The username and password created here are needed to log in and work with "
"your Linux system. With <b>Automatic Login</b> enabled, the login procedure "
"is skipped. This user is logged in automatically.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ສ້າງຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນໃນການເຂົ້າລະບົບ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານລະບົບ Linux ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກເປີດ"
"ໃຊ້ <b>ການເຂົ້າລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດ</b>, ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະບົບໂດຍ"
"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</p>\n"

#. help text 5/7 (only during installation)
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:253
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Have mail for root forwarded to this user by checking <b>Receive System "
"Mail</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຕໍ່ເມລຂອງ root ໄປຫາຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ໂດຍການເລືອກ <b>ຮັບເມລລະບົບ</b>.</p>\n"

#. help text 6/7 (only during installation)
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:258
msgid ""
"<p>Press <b>User Management</b> to add more users or groups to your system.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ກົດ <b>ການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້</b> ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ.</p>"

#. alternative help text 4/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:267
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"To see more details, such as the home directory or the user ID, click\n"
"<b>Details</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ ຫຼື ໄອດີຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ\n"
"<b>ລາຍລະອຽດ</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. alternative help text 5/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:275
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"To edit various password settings of this user, such as expiration date, "
"click <b>Password Settings</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ່າງໆຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ ເຊັ່ນ ວັນໝົດອາຍຸ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>.</"
"p>\n"

#. help text 7/7
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:285
msgid ""
"<p>To forbid this user to\n"
"log in, check <b>Disable User Login</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອຫ້າມບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້\n"
"ເຂົ້າລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ປິດການເຂົ້າລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້</b>.</p>"

#. help text 1/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:303
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Enter the group data here.   \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນກຸ່ມຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້.   \n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 2/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:305
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Group Name:</b>\n"
"Avoid long names for groups. Normal lengths are between \n"
"two and eight characters.  \n"
"You can redefine the list of characters allowed for group names in\n"
"the /etc/login.defs file. Read its man page for information.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ຊື່ກຸ່ມ:</b>\n"
"ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໃຊ້ຊື່ກຸ່ມທີ່ຍາວເກີນໄປ. ຄວາມຍາວປົກກະຕິແມ່ນລະຫວ່າງ \n"
"ສອງ ຫາ ແປດ ຕົວອັກສອນ.  \n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດລາຍຊື່ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຊື່ກຸ່ມໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນ\n"
"ໄຟລ໌ /etc/login.defs. ອ່ານລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ man page.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 3/6, %1 is number
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:316
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Group ID (gid):</b>\n"
"In addition to its name, a group must be assigned a numerical ID for its\n"
"internal representation. These values are between 0 and\n"
"%1. Some of the IDs are already assigned during installation. You will be\n"
"warned if you try to use an already set one.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ໄອດີກຸ່ມ (gid):</b>\n"
"ນອກຈາກຊື່ແລ້ວ, ກຸ່ມຈະຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໄອດີຕົວເລກສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນ.\n"
"ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ\n"
"%1. ບາງໄອດີແມ່ນໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດແລ້ວໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບ\n"
"ຄຳເຕືອນຫາກພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ໄອດີທີ່ມີຄົນໃຊ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 6/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:329
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Group Members:</b>\n"
"Here, select which users should be members of this group.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ສະມາຊິກກຸ່ມ:</b>\n"
"ທີ່ນີ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຄວນເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງກຸ່ມນີ້.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. additional helptext for EditFroup dialog
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:341
msgid ""
"The second list shows users for which this group is the default\n"
"        group. The default group can only be changed by editing the user."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ທີສອງສະແດງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນີ້ເປັນກຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"        ກຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຕົວຜູ້ໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. Help for EditUserDetailsDialog.
#.
#. @param [String] user_type type of added/edited user (local/system/ldap/nis)
#. @param [String] what what to do with a user (add_user/edit_user)
#.
#. @return [String] help text
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:360
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Additional user data includes:\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມປະກອບມີ:\n"
"</p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a number
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:363
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>User ID (uid):</b>\n"
"Each user is known to the system by a unique number,\n"
"the user ID. For normal users, you should use\n"
"a UID larger than %1 because the smaller UIDs are used\n"
"by the system for special purposes and pseudo logins.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ໄອດີຜູ້ໃຊ້ (uid):</b>\n"
"ລະບົບຈະຮູ້ຈັກຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນຜ່ານຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ,\n"
"ນັ້ນຄື ໄອດີຜູ້ໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້\n"
"UID ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ %1 ເພາະ UID ທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້\n"
"ໂດຍລະບົບເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງພິເສດ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າລະບົບຈຳລອງ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:374
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you change the UID of an existing user, the rights of the files\n"
"this user owns must be changed. This is done automatically\n"
"for the files in the user's home directory, but not for files \n"
"located elsewhere.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນ UID ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່, ສິດຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງ\n"
"ກໍຕ້ອງຖືກປ່ຽນນຳ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ\n"
"ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ລວມເຖິງໄຟລ໌ \n"
"ທີ່ຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:381
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Home Directory:</b>\n"
"The home directory of the user. Normally this is\n"
"/home/username. \n"
"To select an existing directory, click <b>Browse</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ:</b>\n"
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ\n"
"/home/ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້. \n"
"ເພື່ອເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <b>ເລືອກ</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text for user's home directory mode
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:392
msgid ""
"<p>Optionally, set the <b>Home Directory Permission Mode</b> for this user's "
"home directory different from the default.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງ <b>ໂໝດການອະນຸຍາດໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ</b> ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້.</p>"

#. help text for an empty home option
#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a path to directory (e.g. '/etc/skel')
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:400
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"<p>To create only an empty home directory,\n"
"check <b>Empty Home</b>. Otherwise, the new home directory\n"
"is created from the default skeleton (%1).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອສ້າງພຽງແຕ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ,\n"
"ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຫວ່າງເປົ່າ</b>. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກໃໝ່\n"
"ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ skeleton ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (%1).</p>\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text for the Btrfs subvolume checkbox
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:410
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>%s</b> option allows to create the user home as a subvolume instead of "
"a plain directory whenever there is a Btrfs filesystem available.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຕົວເລືອກ <b>%s</b> ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປັນ subvolume ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທົ່"
"ວໄປ ເມື່ອມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ Btrfs ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ.</p>"

#. help text for Move to new location checkbox
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:417
msgid ""
"<p>If changing the location of a user's home directory, move the contents of "
"the current directory with <b>Move to New Location</b>, activated by "
"default. Otherwise a new home directory is created without any of the "
"existing data.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປັດຈຸບັນໄປນຳດ້ວຍ <b>ຍ້າຍໄປຍັ"
"ງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່</b>, ເຊິ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ"
"ເລີຍ.</p>"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:425
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The home directory of an LDAP user can be changed only on the\n"
"file server.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ LDAP ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ຢູ່ທີ່\n"
"ເຊີເວີໄຟລ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:431
msgid ""
"<p><b>Additional Information:</b>\n"
"Some additional user data could be set here. This field may contain up to\n"
"three parts, separated by commas. The standard usage is to write\n"
"<i>office</i>,<i>work phone</i>,<i>home phone</i>. This information is \n"
"shown when you use the <i>finger</i> command on this user.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:</b>\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້. ຊ່ອງນີ້ອາດຈະມີໄດ້ສູງສຸດ\n"
"ສາມສ່ວນ, ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ການໃຊ້ງານມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນການຂຽນ\n"
"<i>ຫ້ອງການ</i>,<i>ເບີໂທລະສັບບ່ອນເຮັດວຽກ</i>,<i>ເບີໂທລະສັບບ້ານ</i>. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະ \n"
"ສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ <i>finger</i> ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້.</p>\n"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:440
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Login Shell:</b>\n"
"The login shell (command interpreter) for the user.\n"
"Select a shell from the list of all shells installed\n"
"on your system.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ເຊລເຂົ້າລະບົບ:</b>\n"
"ເຊລເຂົ້າລະບົບ (ຕົວແປຄຳສັ່ງ) ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້.\n"
"ເລືອກເຊລຈາກລາຍຊື່ຂອງເຊລທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:449
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Default Group:</b>\n"
"The primary group to which the user belongs. Select one group\n"
"from the list of all groups existing on your system.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ກຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:</b>\n"
"ກຸ່ມຫຼັກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສັງກັດ. ເລືອກໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມ\n"
"ຈາກລາຍຊື່ກຸ່ມທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/users/helps.rb:456
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Additional Groups:</b>\n"
"Select additional groups in which the user should be a member.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ກຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມ:</b>\n"
"ເລືອກກຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນຈະເປັນສະມາຊິກ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. helptxt for plugin dialog 1/2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:469
msgid ""
"<p>Here, see the list of plug-ins, the\n"
"extensions of user and group configuration.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທີ່ນີ້, ເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງປລັກອິນ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນ\n"
"ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຸ່ມ.</p>\n"

#. helptext for plugin dialog 2/3
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:473
msgid ""
"The check mark in the left part of the table indicates that the plug-in\n"
"is currently in use."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກໃນສ່ວນເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງຕາຕະລາງບົ່ງບອກວ່າປລັກອິນ\n"
"ກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#. helptext for plugin dialog 3/3
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:477
msgid ""
"<p>Start the detailed configuration of a particular plug-in by selecting "
"<b>Launch</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລີ່ມການກຳນົດຄ່າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງປລັກອິນໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍການເລືອກ <b>ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ</b>.</p>"

#. help texts 1/1
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:487
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Save the current user and group settings to the system.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຸ່ມປັດຈຸບັນລົງໃນລະບົບ.\n"
"</p>"

#. Help text 1/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:498
msgid ""
"<p>Activate <b>Force Password Change</b> to force the user to change the\n"
"password at the next login. If <b>Last Password Change</b> is set to\n"
"<i>Never</i>, the user will be forced to change the password.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເປີດໃຊ້ <b>ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b> ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນ\n"
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ. ຫາກ <b>ການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ</b> ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ\n"
"<i>ບໍ່ເຄີຍ</i>, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ.</p>"

#. Help text 2/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:504
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Days before Password Expiration to Issue Warning</B><BR>\n"
"Users can be warned before their passwords expire. Set \n"
"how long before expiration the warning should be issued. Set -1 to disable\n"
"the warning. \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ຈຳນວນມື້ກ່ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານໝົດອາຍຸເພື່ອແຈ້ງເຕືອນ</B><BR>\n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ອນທີ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະໝົດອາຍຸ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"ໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນໝົດອາຍຸທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. ຕັ້ງເປັນ -1 ເພື່ອປິດ\n"
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Help text 3/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:513
msgid ""
"<P><B>Days after Password Expires with Usable Login</B><BR>\n"
"Users can log in after their passwords have expired. Set how many days to\n"
"allow login. Use -1 for unlimited access.\n"
"</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ຍັງເຂົ້າລະບົບໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກລະຫັດຜ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ</B><BR>\n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າລະບົບໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກລະຫັດຜ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ຈະ\n"
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ. ໃຊ້ -1 ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ.\n"
"</P>\n"

#. Help text 4/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:520
msgid ""
"<P><B>Maximum Number of Days for the Same Password</B><BR>Set how many days "
"a user \n"
"can use the same password before it expires.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ຈຳນວນມື້ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເດີມ</B><BR>ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ \n"
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເດີມໄດ້ຈັກມື້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ.</P>\n"

#. Help text 5/6
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:524
msgid ""
"<P><B>Minimum Number of Days for the Same Password</B><BR>Set the minimum "
"age of \n"
"a password before a user is allowed to change it.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ຈຳນວນມື້ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເດີມ</B><BR>ຕັ້ງຄ່າອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານຕ່ຳສຸດ \n"
"ຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານກ່ອນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປ່ຽນມັນ.</P>\n"

#. Help text 6/6 : Don't reorder letters YYYY-MM-DD, date must be set in this format
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:528
msgid ""
"<P><B>Expiration Date</B><BR>Set the date when this account expires. \n"
"The date must be in the format YYYY-MM-DD. \n"
"Leave it empty if this account never expires.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ວັນໝົດອາຍຸ</B><BR>ຕັ້ງວັນທີທີ່ບັນຊີນີ້ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ. \n"
"ວັນທີຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ YYYY-MM-DD. \n"
"ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຫວ່າງຖ້າບັນຊີນີ້ບໍ່ມີວັນໝົດອາຍຸ.</P>\n"

#. help text 1/2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:538
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Configuration Overview</b><br>\n"
"Here, see a summary of modules that could affect sources\n"
"of user accounts or authentication type.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ພາບລວມການກຳນົດຄ່າ</b><br>\n"
"ທີ່ນີ້, ເບິ່ງບົດສະຫຼຸບຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"ຂອງບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປະເພດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 2/2
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:546
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Changing the Values</b><br>\n"
"You can configure these settings by running appropriate modules. Select the "
"module with <b>Configure</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>ການປ່ຽນຄ່າຕ່າງໆ</b><br>\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ເລືອກໂມດູນດ້ວຍ <b>ກຳນົດຄ່າ</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. @return [String] Help text for the authorized keys dialog
#: src/include/users/helps.rb:558
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"List of public keys that the user can use to authenticate when logging in "
"via SSH.\n"
"You can select any public key from your computer through the <b>Add...</b> "
"button.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ລາຍຊື່ຄີສາທາລະນະທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເມື່ອເຂົ້າລະບົບຜ່ານ SSH.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຄີສາທາລະນະໃດໜຶ່ງຈາກຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານປຸ່ມ <b>ເພີ່ມ...</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text for Password Policy Dialog
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:62
msgid ""
"<p>Select the <b>Password Change Policies</b>, <b>Password Aging Policies</"
"b>, and <b>Lockout Policies</b> tabs to choose LDAP password policy groups "
"of attributes to configure.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກແຖບ <b>ນະໂຍບາຍການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>, <b>ນະໂຍບາຍອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>, ແລ"
"ະ <b>ນະໂຍບາຍການລັອກບັນຊີ</b> ເພື່ອເລືອກກຸ່ມຄຸນລັກສະນະນະໂຍບາຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ LDAP ທີ່ຈະກຳນົດຄ່າ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdInHistory attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:70
msgid ""
"<p>Specify the <b>Maximum Number of Passwords Stored in History</b> to set "
"how many previously used passwords should be saved. Saved passwords may not "
"be used.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ລະບຸ <b>ຈຳນວນລະຫັດຜ່ານສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນປະຫວັດ</b> ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຫ້ບັນທຶກລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ກ່"
"ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈັກອັນ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ຄືນໄດ້.</p>"

#. help text for pwdMustChange attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:74
msgid ""
"<p>Check <b>User Must Change Password after Reset</b> to force users to "
"change their passwords after the the password is reset or changed by an "
"administrator.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກ <b>ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່</b> ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງພວກເຂົາ ຫຼັງ"
"ຈາກທີ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຖືກປ່ຽນໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdAllowUserChange attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:78
msgid ""
"<p>Check <b>User Can Change Password</b> to allow users to change their "
"passwords.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກ <b>ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານໄດ້</b> ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງພວກເຂົາເອງ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdSafeModify attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:82
msgid ""
"<p>If the existing password must be provided along with the new password, "
"check <b>Old Password Required for Password Change</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຫາກຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານເກົ່າຄູ່ກັບລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເກົ່າໃນການປ່ຽນລະຫັ"
"ດຜ່ານ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for pwdCheckQuality attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:86
msgid ""
"<p>Select whether the password quality should be verified while passwords "
"are modified or added. Select <b>No Checking</b> if passwords should not be "
"checked at all. With <b>Accept Uncheckable Passwords</b>, passwords are "
"accepted even if the check cannot be performed, for example, if the user has "
"provided an encrypted password. With <b>Only Accept Checked Passwords</b> "
"passwords are refused if the quality test fails or the password cannot be "
"checked.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼືບໍ່. ເລືອກ <b>ບໍ່"
"ມີການກວດສອບ</b> ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ກວດສອບລະຫັດຜ່ານເລີຍ. ຫາກເລືອກ <b>ຍອມຮັບລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ກວດສອບບໍ່ໄ"
"ດ້</b>, ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ກໍຕາມ ເຊັ່ນ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່"
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້ແລ້ວ. ຫາກເລືອກ <b>ຍອມຮັບສະເພາະລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບ</b> ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກປະຕິເສ"
"ດຫາກການທົດສອບຄຸນນະພາບຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບລະຫັດຜ່ານໄດ້.</p>"

#. help text for pwdMinLength attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:90
msgid ""
"Set the minimum number of characters that must be used in a password in "
"<b>Minimum Password Length</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ <b>ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ່ຳສຸດ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for pwdMinAge attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:94
msgid ""
"<p><b>Minimum Password Age</b> sets how much time must pass between "
"modifications to the password.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ່ຳສຸດ</b> ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງຜ່ານໄປລະຫວ່າງການແກ້ໄຂລະຫັດຜ່ານແຕ່ລ"
"ະຄັ້ງ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdMaxAge attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:98
msgid ""
"<p><b>Maximum Password Age</b> sets how long after modification a password "
"expires.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານລະຫັດຜ່ານສູງສຸດ</b> ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາຫຼັງຈາກການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະໝົດອາຍຸ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdExpireWarning attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:102
msgid ""
"<p>In <b>Time before Password Expiration to Issue Warning</b> set how long "
"before a password is due to expire that an expiration warning messages "
"should be given to an authenticating user.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນ <b>ໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານໝົດອາຍຸເພື່ອແຈ້ງເຕືອນ</b> ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະໝົດອ"
"າຍຸ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນການໝົດອາຍຸແກ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກຳລັງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdGraceAuthNLimit attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:106
msgid ""
"<p>Set the number of times an expired password can be used to authenticate "
"in <b>Allowed Uses of an Expired Password</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄດ້ໃນ <b>ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລ"
"ະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for pwdLockout attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:110
msgid ""
"<p>Check <b>Enable Password Locking</b> to forbid use of a password after a "
"specified number of consecutive failed bind attempts.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກ <b>ເປີດໃຊ້ການລັອກລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b> ເພື່ອຫ້າມການໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ "
"(bind) ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຕິດຕໍ່ກັນຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ລະບຸ.</p>"

#. help text for pwdMaxFailure attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:114
msgid ""
"<p>Set the number of consecutive failed bind  attempts after which the "
"password may not be used to authenticate in <b>Bind Failures to Lock the "
"Password</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຄັ້ງຂອງການພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄ"
"ດ້ໃນ <b>ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວເພື່ອລັອກລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for pwdLockoutDuration attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:118
msgid ""
"<p>Set how long the password cannot be used in <b>Password Lock Duration</b>."
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ <b>ໄລຍະເວລາການລັອກລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for pwdFailureCountInterval attribute
#: src/include/users/ldap_dialogs.rb:122
msgid ""
"<p><b>Bind Failures Cache Duration</b> sets how long before password "
"failures are purged from the failure counter even though no successful "
"authentication has occurred.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ໄລຍະເວລາການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ</b> ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນການລົ້ມເຫຼວຂອງລະຫັດຜ່າ"
