"<b>DES</b>, the Linux default method, works in all network environments, but "
"it\n"
"restricts passwords to eight characters or less.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເລືອກວິທີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ.\n"
"<b>DES</b>, ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Linux, ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນທຸກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແຕ່\n"
"ມັນຈຳກັດລະຫັດຜ່ານໃຫ້ມີພຽງແປດຕົວອັກສອນ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Help text for password expert dialog 3/5
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:444
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>MD5</b> allows longer passwords, so provides more security, but some\n"
"network protocols do not support this and you may have problems with NIS.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>MD5</b> ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ຍາວກວ່າ, ຈຶ່ງໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແຕ່ບາງ\n"
"ໂປຣໂຕຄໍເຄືອຂ່າຍບໍ່ຮອງຮັບວິທີນີ້ ແລະ ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາກັບ NIS.\n"
"</p>"

#. Help text for password expert dialog 4/5
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:455
msgid ""
"<p><b>SHA-512</b> is the current standard hash method. Using other "
"algorithms is not recommended unless needed for compatibility purposes.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>SHA-512</b> ແມ່ນວິທີການແຮຊ (hash) ມາດຕະຖານໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມອື່ນ ເວັ້ນເ"
"ສຍແຕ່ຈະຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບລະບົບອື່ນ.</p>"

#. Label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:463
msgid "Password Encryption"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#. frame label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:471
msgid "Encryption Type"
msgstr "ປະເພດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#. Radio buttons for password encryption: DES-crypt
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:477
msgid "&DES"
msgstr "&DES"

#. Radio buttons for password encryption: MD5-crypt
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:479
msgid "&MD5"
msgstr "&MD5"

#. Radio buttons for password encryption: sha256 crypt
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:484
msgid "SHA-&256"
msgstr "SHA-&256"

#. Radio buttons for password encryption: sha512 crypt
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:492
msgid "SHA-&512"
msgstr "SHA-&512"

#. help text 1/3
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:546
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You have changed the default encryption for user passwords.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ທ່ານໄດ້ປ່ຽນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບລະຫັດຜ່ານຜູ້ໃຊ້.</p>"

#. help text 2/3
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:550
msgid ""
"<p>It seems that you are running a NIS server. In some network "
"environments,\n"
"you might be unable to log in to a NIS client when a user password is\n"
"encrypted with a method other than DES.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ເຊີເວີ NIS. ໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄືອຂ່າຍ,\n"
"ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ NIS ໄດ້ ຫາກລະຫັດຜ່ານຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖືກ\n"
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍວິທີອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ DES.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text 3/3
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:557
msgid "<p>Really use the selected method?</p>"
msgstr "<p>ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ວິທີທີ່ເລືອກນີ້ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?</p>"

#. combo box item
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:683
msgid "AND"
msgstr "AND"

#. combo box item
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:685
msgid "OR"
msgstr "OR"

#. helptext 1/4 - caption
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:692
msgid "<p><b>LDAP Search Filter Changes</b></p>"
msgstr "<p><b>ການປ່ຽນແປງຕົວຕອງການຄົ້ນຫາ LDAP</b></p>"

#. helptext 2/4
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:694
msgid ""
"<p>Here, extend the search filters for users and groups beyond the default "
"search filters.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທີ່ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຕົວຕອງການຄົ້ນຫາສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຸ່ມ ໃຫ້ເກີນກວ່າຕົວຕອງການຄົ້ນຫາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄ"
"ດ້.</p>"

#. helptext 3/4
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:698
msgid ""
"<p>With <b>Default</b>, load the default filter from the user and group\n"
"configuration modules saved on the LDAP server (values of 'suseSearchFilter' "
"attributes).\n"
"If you are not connected yet, you are prompted for the password.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ດ້ວຍ <b>ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</b>, ຈະໂຫຼດຕົວຕອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກໂມດູນການກຳນົດຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຸ່ມ\n"
"ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີ LDAP (ຄ່າຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະ 'suseSearchFilter').\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ລະບົບຈະຖາມຫາລະຫັດຜ່ານ.</p>\n"

#. helptext 4/4 (do not translate the value (written as <tt> font))
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:704
msgid ""
"<p><b>Example:</b>\n"
"<br>With the user filter\n"
"<br>\n"
"<tt>(&(objectClass=posixAccount)(uid=u*))</tt>\n"
"<br>\n"
"only obtain users with a username beginning with 'u'.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຕົວຢ່າງ:</b>\n"
"<br>ດ້ວຍຕົວຕອງຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"<br>\n"
"<tt>(&(objectClass=posixAccount)(uid=u*))</tt>\n"
"<br>\n"
"ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ 'u' ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>\n"

#. radiobutton label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:727
msgid "Search Filter for &Users"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງການຄົ້ນຫາສຳລັບ &ຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. radiobutton label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:736
msgid "Search Filter for &Groups"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງການຄົ້ນຫາສຳລັບ &ກຸ່ມ"

#. frame label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:747
msgid "New Condition for Current Filter"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂໃໝ່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງປັດຈຸບັນ"

#. combobox label
#. combobox label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:759 src/include/users/widgets.rb:913
msgid "&Attribute"
msgstr "&ຄຸນລັກສະນະ"

#. textentry label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:767
msgid "&Value"
msgstr "&ຄ່າ"

#. pushbuttton label
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:770
msgid "A&dd to Filter"
msgstr "ເ&ພີ່ມໃສ່ຕົວຕອງ"

