msgstr "ຕ້ອງການລຶບກຸ່ມລະບົບນີ້ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. yes-no popup, %1 si group name
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:1200
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Really delete the group %1?\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ຕ້ອງການລຶບກຸ່ມ %1 ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?\n"

#. warning popup
#: src/include/users/widgets.rb:1210
msgid ""
"You cannot delete this group because\n"
"there are users in the group.\n"
"Remove these users from the group first.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບກຸ່ມນີ້ໄດ້ ເພາະວ່າ\n"
"ມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມນີ້.\n"
