#. @return [String] formatted and localized text
#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:774
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Use one of the available options to add local users to the system.\n"
"Local users are stored in <i>/etc/passwd</i> and <i>/etc/shadow</i>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບ.\n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ <i>/etc/passwd</i> ແລະ <i>/etc/shadow</i>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. @return [String] formatted and localized text
#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:782
msgid "Create new user"
msgstr "ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່"

#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:787
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"When entering a password, distinguish between uppercase and\n"
"lowercase. Passwords should not contain any accented characters or umlauts.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເວລາປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແຍກລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ ແລະ\n"
"ຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານບໍ່ຄວນມີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສຽງ ຫຼື umlauts.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:798
msgid ""
"<p>Check <b>Use this password for system administrator</b> if the same "
"password as entered for the first user should be used for root.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໝາຍເລືອກ <b>ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ</b> ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານດຽວກັນ ກັບທີ່ປ້ອນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ"
"ຳອິດສຳລັບ root.</p>"

#. @return [String] formatted and localized text
#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:813
msgid "Import User Data from a Previous Installation"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຄັ້ງກ່ອນ"

#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:814
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"A previous Linux installation with local users has been detected.\n"
"The information there can be used to create users in the system being "
"installed.\n"
"Use the <b>Choose Users</b> button to select some users. Their basic "
"information will\n"
"be imported.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ກວດພົບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Linux ຄັ້ງກ່ອນທີ່ມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງກ່າວສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້.\n"
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <b>ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້</b> ເພື່ອເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກເຂົາຈະ\n"
"ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. @return [String] formatted and localized text
#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:824
msgid "Skip User Creation"
msgstr "ຂ້າມການສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:825
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Sometimes root is the only needed local user, like in network environments\n"
"with an authentication server. Select this option to proceed without "
"creating\n"
"a local user.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ບາງຄັ້ງ root ເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນດຽວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ເຊັ່ນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄືອຂ່າຍ\n"
"ທີ່ມີເຊີເວີຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງ\n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: %{min} and %{max} will be replaced by numbers
#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:838
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The password length should be between %{min}\n"
" and %{max} characters.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ %{min}\n"
" ຫາ %{max} ຕົວອັກສອນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Explanation of the format the user name must follow in order to be valid
#.
#. @return [String] formatted and localized text
#: src/lib/users/dialogs/inst_user_first.rb:848
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"For the <b>Username</b> use only letters (no accented characters), digits, "
"and <tt>._-</tt>.\n"
"Do not use uppercase letters in this entry unless you know what you are "
"doing.\n"
"Usernames have stricter restrictions than passwords. You can redefine the\n"
"restrictions in the /etc/login.defs file. Read its man page for "
"information.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ສຳລັບ <b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b> ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນ (ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສຽງ), ຕົວເລກ, ແລະ <tt>._-</tt>.\n"
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ໃນຊ່ອງນີ້ ນອກຈາກເຈົ້າຈະຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່.\n"
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ເເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ກຳນົດ\n"
"ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ /etc/login.defs. ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າ man page.\n"
"</p>\n"

