#. rubocop:disable Metrics/MethodLength
#. help text ( explain what the user "root" is and does ) 1
#: src/lib/users/widgets.rb:145
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Unlike normal users of the system, who write texts, create\n"
"graphics, or browse the Internet, the user \"root\" exists on\n"
"every system and is called into action whenever\n"
"administrative tasks need to be performed. Only log in as root\n"
"when you need to be the system administrator.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ຕ່າງຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ປົກກະຕິຂອງລະບົບ ທີ່ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ສ້າງ\n"
"ຮູບພາບ, ຫຼື ທ່ອງອິນເຕີເນັດ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ \"root\" ມີຢູ່ໃນ\n"
"ທຸກລະບົບ ແລະ ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມ\n"
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປະຕິບັດວຽກງານບໍລິຫານລະບົບ. ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບເປັນ root\n"
"ສະເພາະເມື່ອເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text, continued 2
#: src/lib/users/widgets.rb:156
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Because the root user is equipped with extensive permissions, the password\n"
"for \"root\" should be chosen carefully. A combination of letters and "
"numbers\n"
"is recommended. To ensure that the password was entered correctly,\n"
"reenter it in a second field.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ມີສິດອຳນາດສູງ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານ\n"
"ສຳລັບ \"root\" ຄວນຖືກເລືອກຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ\n"
"ກັບຕົວເລກ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງ,\n"
"ໃຫ້ປ້ອນມັນຄືນອີກຄັ້ງໃນຊ່ອງທີສອງ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text, continued 3
#: src/lib/users/widgets.rb:166
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"All the rules for user passwords apply to the \"root\" password:\n"
"Distinguish between uppercase and lowercase. A password should have at\n"
"least 5 characters and, as a rule, not contain any accented letters or "
"umlauts.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ກົດລະບຽບທັງໝົດສຳລັບລະຫັດຜ່ານຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ກັບລະຫັດຜ່ານ \"root\" ເຊັ່ນກັນ:\n"
"ແຍກແຍະລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານຄວນມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ\n"
"5 ຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕາມກົດແລ້ວ ບໍ່ຄວນມີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສຽງ ຫຼື umlauts.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. help text, continued 4
#: src/lib/users/widgets.rb:177
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Do not forget this \"root\" password.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ຢ່າລືມລະຫັດຜ່ານ \"root\" ນີ້.\n"
"</p>"

#. @see CWM::AbstractWidget
#: src/lib/users/widgets/inst_root_first.rb:63
msgid "You need to provide at least a password or a public key."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງລະຫັດຜ່ານ ຫຼື ກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະ (public key)."

#. @return [String] Widget label
#: src/lib/users/widgets/public_key_selector.rb:51
msgid "Import Public SSH Key"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະ SSH"

#. Returns the help text regarding the use of a public key for authentication
#.
#. @return [String] Help text
#: src/lib/users/widgets/public_key_selector.rb:111
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"In some situations it is preferred to access to the system remotely via SSH\n"
"using a public key instead of a password. This screen allows you to select\n"
"one public key from an USB stick, a CD/DVD ROM or even from an existing\n"
"partition.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"If the public key is stored on a removable device, you do not need to keep\n"
"the device connected during the whole installation. You can remove it right\n"
"after selecting the key.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Take into account that the root password and the public key are not "
"mutually\n"
"exclusive: you can provide both if you want.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ, ມັນດີກວ່າທີ່ຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບທາງໄກຜ່ານ SSH\n"
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະແທນລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ໜ້ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກ\n"
"ກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະໜຶ່ງອັນຈາກ USB, CD/DVD ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ຈາກພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນ (partition)\n"
"ທີ່ມີຢູ່.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"ຫາກກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່\n"
"ອຸປະກອນນັ້ນໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຖອດມັນອອກໄດ້ທັນທີ\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກກຸນແຈແລ້ວ.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານ root ແລະ ກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຂັດກັນ:\n"
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຫ້ທັງສອງຢ່າງໄດ້ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: the public key does not contain a comment (which  is often used as some sort
#. of description in order to identify the key)
#: src/lib/users/widgets/public_key_selector.rb:202
msgid "no comment"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#. Displays an error about the device which failed to be mounted
#.
#. @param device [String] Device's name
