msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ %{user} ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ."

#: src/lib/y2users/collision_checker.rb:74
#, perl-brace-format
msgid "Groups %{groups} have same GID %{gid}."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ %{groups} ມີ GID %{gid} ຊ້ຳກັນ."

#: src/lib/y2users/collision_checker.rb:83
#, perl-brace-format
msgid "Group %{name} is specified multiple times."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ %{name} ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ."

#. #-#-#-#-#  users.rxgettext.pot (PACKAGE VERSION)  #-#-#-#-#
#. NOTE: to avoid dependencies, this help text is a duplicate of
#. Yast::UsersSimple.ValidPasswordHelpText. Please, keep them in sync.
#. #-#-#-#-#  users.xgettext.pot  #-#-#-#-#
#. NOTE: To avoid dependencies, this help text has been duplicated at
#. Y2Users::HelpTexts#valid_password_text. Please, keep them in sync.
#: src/lib/y2users/help_texts.rb:51 src/modules/UsersSimple.pm:200
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"For the password, use only characters that can be found on an English "
"keyboard\n"
"layout.  In cases of system error, it may be necessary to log in without a\n"
"localized keyboard layout.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ສຳລັບລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ພົບໄດ້ໃນແປ້ນພິມພາສາອັງກິດ\n"
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າລະບົບໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີ\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແປ້ນພິມທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.\n"
"</p>"

#. Text about the CA constraints, if applicable
#.
#. @return [String] formatted and localized text if feature is enabled, empty string otherwise
#: src/lib/y2users/help_texts.rb:67
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you intend to use this password for creating certificates,\n"
"it has to be at least %s characters long.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ,\n"
"ມັນຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ %s ຕົວອັກສອນ.</p>"

