"ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ ຫຼື mail spool ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ %{user} ໄດ້: %{error}"

#. TRANSLATORS: %{user} is replaced by a username and %{error} is replaced by an error
#. message.
#: src/lib/y2users/linux/delete_user_action.rb:134
#, perl-brace-format
