msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້ %{user} ໄດ້: %{error}"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a placeholder for a username
#: src/lib/y2users/linux/delete_user_password_action.rb:62
