msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ '%s'"

#. Updates root aliases
#.
#. @see #root_alias_candidates
#.
#. Issues are generated if the root aliases cannot be set
#: src/lib/y2users/linux/users_writer.rb:204
