msgstr ""
"ມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄົນທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນ (\"%2\") ໃນໄຟລ໌ %1.\n"
"%3"

#. error message 1/2: %1 is file name, %2 is groupname, %3 next sentence (2/2)
#: src/modules/UsersUI.rb:515
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"There are multiple groups with the same name (\"%2\") in the file %1.\n"
"%3"
msgstr ""
"ມີກຸ່ມຫຼາຍກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນ (\"%2\") ໃນໄຟລ໌ %1.\n"
"%3"

#. error message 1/2: %1 is file name, %2 is line
#. error message 1/2: %1 is file name, %2 is line
#: src/modules/UsersUI.rb:524 src/modules/UsersUI.rb:535
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"There is a strange line in the file %1:\n"
"%2\n"
"Perhaps the number of colons is wrong or some line entry is missing.\n"
"Correct the file manually before running the YaST users module again."
msgstr ""
"ມີແຖວທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິໃນໄຟລ໌ %1:\n"
"%2\n"
"ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນຈຳນວນ colon (:) ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ບາງຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຖວຫາຍໄປ.\n"
"ກະລຸນາແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດໂມດູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ YaST ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. error message 1/2: %1 is file name
#: src/modules/UsersUI.rb:546
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"There is a strange line in the file %1.\n"
"Perhaps the number of colons is wrong or some line entry is missing.\n"
"Correct the file manually before running the YaST users module again."
msgstr ""
"ມີແຖວທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິໃນໄຟລ໌ %1.\n"
"ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນຈຳນວນ colon (:) ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ບາງຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຖວຫາຍໄປ.\n"
"ກະລຸນາແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດໂມດູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ YaST ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. default error message
#: src/modules/UsersUI.rb:556
msgid "Cannot read user or group data."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມໄດ້."

#. Popup text: %1 is the file name (e.g. /etc/fstab),
#. %2 is the directory (e.g. /home),
#: src/modules/Users.pm:748
msgid ""
"In %1, there is a mount point for the directory\n"
"%2, which is used as a default home directory for new\n"
"users, but this directory is not currently mounted.\n"
"If you add new users using the default values,\n"
"their home directories will be created in the current %2.\n"
"This can result in these directories not being accessible\n"
"after you mount correctly. Continue user configuration?"
msgstr ""
"ໃນ %1, ມີຈຸດເມົາທ໌ສຳລັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ\n"
"%2, ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"ໃໝ່, ແຕ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເມົາທ໌ (mount) ໃນຂະນະນີ້.\n"
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ,\n"
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງພວກເຂົາຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ %2 ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຈົ້າເມົາທ໌ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕໍ່ຫຼືບໍ່?"

